.TH FYNEDESK-CTL 1 "February 2026" "FyneDesk" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
fynedesk-ctl \- command-line interface for FyneDesk compositor
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B fynedesk-ctl
.I command
.RI [ arguments ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B fynedesk-ctl
communicates with a running FyneDesk compositor via its IPC socket to
query state and perform actions.
.SH COMMANDS
.SS Window management
.TP
.B windows \fR[\fB--json\fR]
List all windows. Use \fB--json\fR for machine-readable output.
.TP
.B focus \fIid\fR
Focus the window with the given ID.
.TP
.B close \fIid\fR
Close the window.
.TP
.B minimize \fIid\fR
Minimize the window.
.TP
.B restore \fIid\fR
Restore a minimized window.
.TP
.B maximize \fIid\fR
Maximize the window.
.TP
.B unmaximize \fIid\fR
Restore a maximized window.
.TP
.B fullscreen \fIid\fR
Enter fullscreen.
.TP
.B unfullscreen \fIid\fR
Exit fullscreen.
.TP
.B pin \fIid\fR
Pin window to all desktops.
.TP
.B unpin \fIid\fR
Unpin window.
.TP
.B raise \fIid\fR
Raise window to top.
.TP
.B move-to-desktop \fIid\fR \fIn\fR
Move window to desktop \fIn\fR (0-indexed).
.SS Desktop management
.TP
.B desktop
Show current desktop number and total.
.TP
.B switch-desktop \fIn\fR
Switch to desktop \fIn\fR (0-indexed).
.SS Session
.TP
.B lock
Lock the screen.
.TP
.B logout
Terminate the compositor.
.TP
.B restart
Restart the compositor.
.SS Events
.TP
.B subscribe \fR[\fIevent\fR ...]
Stream events as JSON lines. Available events: windows-state,
desktop-state, notification, volume-change, brightness-change,
keyboard-layout, clipboard-history.
.SS Configuration
.TP
.B config
Show the path to the configuration file.
.SH WINDOW IDS
Window IDs have the format
.I xdg-N
for native Wayland windows or
.I xway-N
for XWayland windows. Use
.B fynedesk-ctl windows
to list current IDs.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
# List windows
fynedesk-ctl windows

# Focus Firefox
fynedesk-ctl focus xdg-3

# Move window to desktop 2
fynedesk-ctl move-to-desktop xdg-3 1

# Subscribe to events
fynedesk-ctl subscribe windows-state desktop-state

# Lock and switch desktop in one script
fynedesk-ctl switch-desktop 0
fynedesk-ctl lock
.fi
.SH FILES
.TP
.I $XDG_RUNTIME_DIR/fynedesk.sock
IPC UNIX socket
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Success
.TP
.B 1
Error (connection failed, invalid arguments, etc.)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR fynedesk-compositor (1),
.BR fynedesk-panel (1),
.BR fynedesk (5)
